1
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:10,838
(Song Group)

2
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,800
You two kids...

3
00:00:14,679 --> 00:00:15,320
Well?

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,399
Business isn't much fun, is it?

5
00:00:23,079 --> 00:00:25,359
You can't even make sense of
the contracts out in the open.

6
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,039
As for the moves behind the scenes,

7
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:28,239
you're even more out of your depth.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,559
Go home while you still can.

9
00:00:30,839 --> 00:00:31,760
It's better for everyone.

10
00:00:33,399 --> 00:00:34,200
Huan,

11
00:00:35,159 --> 00:00:36,840
those photos and that contract...

12
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,960
Were you behind them?

13
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,759
Ms. Song Huan,

14
00:00:43,399 --> 00:00:44,799
facts are facts.

15
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:47,560
I don't understand
the point of doing this.

16
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,479
But the game isn't over.

17
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,439
Who wins and who loses?

18
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:52,479
We'll see.

19
00:00:58,039 --> 00:00:58,799
(Ms. Yu.)

20
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,039
(This way, please.)

21
00:01:09,842 --> 00:01:14,201
=Dear Song=

22
00:01:14,287 --> 00:01:16,908
=Episode 18=
(The Edge of Darkness)

23
00:01:36,837 --> 00:01:40,136
♪Our eyes met amid the chaos♪

24
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,159
Have something sweet.

25
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,159
It'll cheer you up.

26
00:01:42,879 --> 00:01:43,760
Yu Song,

27
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,640
are you treating me like a kid?

28
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,719
Just take a sip.

29
00:01:46,955 --> 00:01:51,600
♪My aching nerves start to twitch♪

30
00:01:51,937 --> 00:01:54,956
♪Will love break when it ends?♪

31
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,400
Can you feel the carbon dioxide bubbles

32
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,439
fizzing in your mouth

33
00:01:58,439 --> 00:02:00,439
and bursting on your tongue?

34
00:02:02,013 --> 00:02:06,254
♪Who will play the heartless one?♪

35
00:02:06,839 --> 00:02:11,680
♪The one who leaves
isn't the one to pity♪

36
00:02:11,935 --> 00:02:16,520
♪The one left behind
sews their tears inside♪

37
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,000
Cheng.

38
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,840
♪Love and hate share a seam♪

39
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,560
None of this is over yet.

40
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,932
♪Half longing♪

41
00:02:24,161 --> 00:02:26,280
♪Half resentment♪

42
00:02:26,932 --> 00:02:31,147
♪Love spreads through the eyes♪

43
00:02:31,696 --> 00:02:33,976
♪It shapes infinity♪

44
00:02:34,222 --> 00:02:36,480
♪A circle turning endlessly♪

45
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,400
Sorry.

46
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,199
Here.

47
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,680
Look at this.

48
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,560
Song Huan set up a high-tech project

49
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:34,159
under a subsidiary
to raise outside funding.

50
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,360
She must have put up part of her shares

51
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,560
and executive authority as collateral

52
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,960
to convince the board.

53
00:03:40,479 --> 00:03:42,560
But that money never went
into the project.

54
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,039
Through
a shareholder-controlled affiliate,

55
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,159
she bought up

56
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:49,840
Song Group's tradable shares
on the secondary market in batches.

57
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,560
Once she's bought up enough,

58
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,199
she can then justify declaring

59
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,960
the high-tech project a failure.

60
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:58,639
Then, with the shares she's bought,

61
00:03:58,639 --> 00:04:00,280
her original stake,

62
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:03,879
and the shareholders
she's already lined up,

63
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:06,879
she can put forward a motion
at the shareholders' meeting

64
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,479
to dilute Dad's stake,

65
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:09,400
and even

66
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:11,759
force him out.

67
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:13,639
Exactly.

68
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,199
The shareholders' meeting is the key.

69
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,639
By then,

70
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:21,160
you and I will still be stuck
in this bribery investigation

71
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,959
and in no position to challenge her.

72
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:26,199
She's got the timing, the means,

73
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,439
and the allies.

74
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,040
Yu Song.

75
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,759
We have to find a way to stop Song Huan.

76
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:37,360
The lab results

77
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,759
for the medication you gave me are back.

78
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,600
Song Huan has long been taking

79
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:43,600
an imported
long-acting anti-anxiety drug.

80
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,199
Because the side effects
aren't clear yet,

81
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:46,800
it's banned in Nigang.

82
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,360
A strong sedative?

83
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,240
Jing.

84
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,199
What exactly are you hiding from me?

85
00:05:04,879 --> 00:05:05,879
What?

86
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:16,639
You and Song Jing
were more than acquaintances, right?

87
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:22,000
Besides helping me,
did you have another reason

88
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,199
for entering the Song household?

89
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,360
Why would someone as powerful
as Song Huan

90
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:31,160
need sleeping pills to fall asleep?

91
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,839
What exactly do you know?

92
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,279
Because she killed someone,

93
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:43,879
she feels guilty

94
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:45,560
and can't sleep well.

95
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,639
Killed someone?

96
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:55,959
I'm sorry, Song.

97
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,600
I lied to you before.

98
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,959
I know how Mr. Song Jing died.

99
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,160
Song Huan

100
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:12,399
is the one
who killed her own younger brother.

101
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:19,240
I grew up with my dad
in the Song household,

102
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:21,839
but we were nothing more than two dogs
the Song family kept around.

103
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,160
In winter,

104
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,680
Song Huan and Song Lin

105
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,439
loved pushing me

106
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:30,240
into the pond.

107
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,800
Just to watch me flail around
like a dog in the water.

108
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,240
Only Mr. Song Jing

109
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:36,560
would reach out

110
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,759
and pull me up.

111
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,800
But life's just not fair.

112
00:06:43,959 --> 00:06:45,160
The kinder someone is,

113
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,680
the worse they get treated.

114
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:53,639
Song Huan and Song Jing were twins,
a girl and a boy.

115
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,040
Song Jing was outstanding,

116
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:57,079
and he was a boy.

117
00:06:58,279 --> 00:07:00,560
Growing up, he always got more attention
from Song Huaishan.

118
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,199
Song Huan was intensely jealous,

119
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:04,800
so she looked down
on her brother even more.

120
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,160
Even if Song Jing scored
just one point higher,

121
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,160
she'd find some other way
to make trouble for him.

122
00:07:10,759 --> 00:07:13,160
But Song Jing never once
went to Song Huaishan to tell on her.

123
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,040
That day,

124
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,600
my dad and I were getting
their birthday party ready.

125
00:07:17,639 --> 00:07:18,333
(I want more.)

126
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,560
No idea what set Song Huan off again,

127
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,079
but she started making trouble.

128
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,439
Mr. Song.

129
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,639
The injured area is too extensive.

130
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:41,240
With current plastic surgery techniques,

131
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:43,079
I'm afraid his face can't be restored.

132
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,079
You're saying

133
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:47,480
my son is disfigured just like that?

134
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:50,560
I believe
as medical technology advances,

135
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,399
there will be better solutions.

136
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,959
What did Song Jing do wrong?

137
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:57,160
He's just a victim
of his sister's bullying.

138
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,879
But Song Huaishan,
for the sake of appearances,

139
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,680
insisted family scandals stay private.

140
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,879
He didn't punish the sister
who had abused him.

141
00:08:05,439 --> 00:08:06,560
Instead,
he pulled Song Jing out of school

142
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,360
and locked him in his room
like some kind of monster,

143
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,360
and wouldn't let him out.

144
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,160
Let me out!

145
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,199
Let me out!

146
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:27,360
Let me out!

147
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:33,159
And that wasn't all.

148
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,559
Song Huan

149
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:36,559
would often taunt him,

150
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,000
her words cutting like a knife

151
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:41,399
into Song Jing's disfigured face.

152
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,840
(My dear little brother,)

153
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,600
(just look at yourself now.)

154
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:54,440
(Even Dad doesn't want to
look at you anymore.)

155
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:56,600
(What's the point of living?)

156
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,519
(You ugly freak.)

157
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,000
(Monster!)

158
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:05,200
(You ugly freak.)

159
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:07,399
Later,

160
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,480
Song Jing finally lost all hope

161
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,279
in this world

162
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,159
and chose to end

163
00:09:13,759 --> 00:09:15,159
his own life.

164
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,879
But Song Huan, the culprit,

165
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:23,759
was only shunned and sidelined
by Song Huaishan.

166
00:09:25,879 --> 00:09:27,399
She lost nothing else.

167
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,000
And soon enough,

168
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,759
even Song Huaishan
couldn't do anything to her.

169
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:43,679
For a family like the Songs,

170
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:44,720
scandal

171
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,960
is harder to accept than death itself.

172
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,639
But Song Huaishan hasn't had
another son in all these years.

173
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,960
That's his karma.

174
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:53,960
Jing,

175
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,480
why didn't you tell me all this before?

176
00:09:56,759 --> 00:09:58,080
Because it's too dangerous.

177
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,799
I was going to get revenge on my own.

178
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,559
I didn't want to drag you into it.

179
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,879
Of everything
we've been through together,

180
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:21,159
what wasn't dangerous?

181
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:26,399
This time, let me help you.
